::ILANG
[TYPE:site-config][PROJECT:dealvolt-promo-radar][VERSION:1][LANG:en]

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# 站点规则的唯一真源。
# scraper.py 与 build.py 都从这里读配置，代码里不另存一份品牌清单。
# 改这里的一个厂商，重跑一次 build.py，站上就该变；变不了说明实现有问题。
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

::META
brand: DealVolt
tagline: Real prices and real promo entries for home appliance and consumer electronics brands
niche: home appliance and consumer electronics brand deals
niche_zh: 家用电器与消费电子品牌优惠
locale: en-US
language: en
currency: USD
base_url: https://dealvolt-promo-radar.pages.dev
data_file: data/offers.json
build_output: site/
max_deals_per_brand: 12
max_products_per_brand: 12
max_pages_to_fetch: 10
min_discount_pct: 1
request_timeout: 30
user_agent: DealVoltPromoRadar/1.0 (+public sitemap and products.json reader)
::END

::RENDER
home_title: {brand} — {niche} tracked from official brand sources ({month})
home_desc: {brand} tracks official prices and promo entries for {brand_count} home appliance and consumer electronics brands. Last checked {date}.
brand_title: {name} Deals and Official Promo Entries — {month} | {brand}
brand_desc: Official {name} promo entries and tracked prices. {deal_count} discounted items found on {date}. All links point to {name}'s own site.
deal_title: {name} {discount}% off — {product} | {brand}
deal_desc: {product} is listed at {price} {currency} (was {compare} {currency}) on {name}'s official site. Source checked {date}.
compare_title: {brand_count} Brand Deal Sources Compared — {month} | {brand}
compare_desc: Side-by-side view of which home appliance and consumer electronics brands currently publish trackable prices or promo pages. Updated {date}.
faq_1_q: Where does this data come from?
faq_1_a: Every entry is read from the brand's own public products feed or product sitemap, or links to a page on the brand's own site. Nothing is typed in by hand.
faq_2_q: How often is it updated?
faq_2_a: An automated job re-reads the public sources on a fixed schedule and rebuilds this site. The timestamp at the bottom of every page shows the last successful run.
faq_3_q: Do you sell these products?
faq_3_a: No. This site does not take orders, hold stock, or set prices. Every outbound link goes to the brand's own official website, where the real and current price lives.
faq_4_q: Why is a brand missing deals?
faq_4_a: A brand shows no discounted items when its public feed lists no item below its own reference price at the time of the run. The official promo links are still listed.
::END

# source 取值：
#   products_json    —— 读 Shopify 公开 products.json（含 compare_at_price，可算真实折扣）
#   sitemap_products —— 读公开 product sitemap，再逐页解析 JSON-LD 的 Product/Offer
#   none             —— 没有可用的公开价格源，只展示官网与官方优惠页
# promo 可重复多行；affiliate 留空表示尚未加入任何联盟计划（不编佣金链接）

::BRAND
slug: momcozy
name: Momcozy
official: https://momcozy.com/
source: products_json
endpoint: https://momcozy.com/products.json?limit=250
promo: https://momcozy.com/pages/offer
promo: https://momcozy.com/pages/prime-big-deal-days
affiliate:
::END

